Extend engine_render_test with more coverage.

Add test cases for all synth modes, effects, song mode, and edge cases.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Test renders audio with subtractive synth
- [ ] Test renders audio with FM synth
- [ ] Test renders audio with wavetable synth
- [ ] Test renders audio with effects enabled (filter, delay, reverb)
- [ ] Test renders song mode (multiple sections)
- [ ] Test renders with all 16 tracks active
- [ ] All render outputs are non-zero and reasonable

## Test Plan
